  "notes": "# 1.0.0-alpha.65\n\n## 中文\n\n- Windows x64 安装包与完整便携版由 GitHub Actions 构建。在线更新继续使用现有签名，发布后逐项验证公开下载，再更新预览通道。\n- GitHub Actions 支持生成 Apple Silicon 和 Intel 构建测试包。macOS 的 Developer ID 签名、公证和实机验收仍在准备中，本次 Release 面向 Windows x64。\n\n## English\n\n- GitHub Actions builds the Windows x64 installer and the complete portable edition. Online updates retain the existing signing key. The preview feed moves forward after the public downloads pass verification.\n- GitHub Actions can build test packages for Apple Silicon and Intel. Developer ID signing, Apple notarization, and interactive Mac testing are pending. This release distributes Windows x64 packages.\n\n## 提交记录 / What's Changed\n\n- ci: 接入 Windows 签名发布并准备 alpha.65 ([97031bb](https://github.com/SerLiunx-ctrl/dbfolio/commit/97031bba91b5b0e6de82c877380396fdb4572dc9))\n- fix: 修正云构建依赖锁定元数据 ([8b018d4](https://github.com/SerLiunx-ctrl/dbfolio/commit/8b018d4c9a77e15759ecc62c6bf25d6336aa9695))\n- ci: 接入 Windows 与 macOS 云端构建 ([4e19b94](https://github.com/SerLiunx-ctrl/dbfolio/commit/4e19b9452f74e8d916e1875076a1ce1f527a122b))\n- chore: 发布 alpha.64 预览更新索引 ([5a9e7f1](https://github.com/SerLiunx-ctrl/dbfolio/commit/5a9e7f10f20d972b41cbffb229d2e93eaefc988a))\n\n## Full Changelog\n\n[v1.0.0-alpha.64...v1.0.0-alpha.65](https://github.com/SerLiunx-ctrl/dbfolio/compare/v1.0.0-alpha.64...v1.0.0-alpha.65)\n",
